1
00:00:00,130 --> 00:00:01,500
Can you lick your elbow?

2
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:02,330
Go on...

3
00:00:02,330 --> 00:00:03,400
gently.

4
00:00:03,440 --> 00:00:03,929
Can't?

5
00:00:03,929 --> 00:00:05,675
Your tongue's fine...

6
00:00:05,675 --> 00:00:06,487
your ARM's

7
00:00:06,487 --> 00:00:07,367
too long.

8
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:09,026
Feel your upper arm?

9
00:00:09,120 --> 00:00:10,614
One stiff bone...

10
00:00:10,614 --> 00:00:12,167
pinned at your shoulder.

11
00:00:12,210 --> 00:00:13,134
Now swing your elbow

12
00:00:13,134 --> 00:00:14,080
to your mouth...

13
00:00:14,080 --> 00:00:15,933
it sails right PAST.

14
00:00:15,980 --> 00:00:17,400
Your mouth sits

15
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:19,307
INSIDE its circle.

16
00:00:19,307 --> 00:00:21,600
The elbow can only go round.

17
00:00:21,638 --> 00:00:23,150
The rare few who can?

18
00:00:23,150 --> 00:00:24,564
Long tongues...

19
00:00:24,564 --> 00:00:26,033
short arms.

20
00:00:26,060 --> 00:00:28,600
Now try the OTHER elbow.

